  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conference on Integrating Sustainable Development and Climate Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The conference on integrating sustainable development and climate change is an important contribution that will feed into the MFAs general work on operationalising climate and development nexus. The objective of the conference is to obtain a better understanding of the synergies, potentials, benefits, and dilemmas in integrating interventions on sustainable development and climate action as well as to further strengthen the strategic dialogue with partners, such as UNDP.</narrative>
  </description>
